Subject: [PATCH] packager: package object methods and storage save

- IOleObject: GetClientSite, SetHostNames, Moniker methods, EnumVerbs (registry), Update/IsUpToDate,
  GetUserClassID/GetUserType, Get/SetExtent (icon size default), Advise/Unadvise/EnumAdvise through an advise holder
- IPersistStorage: GetClassID, IsDirty, InitNew, Save (writes the Ole10Native stream that Load reads),
  SaveCompleted, HandsOffStorage

